<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care regarding your disrupted journey from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your safety is our number one priority</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time, however, bad weather, natural disasters, technical problems and other issues can cause flight delays and cancellations, and your safety is our first priority.<br />
<br />
Though this delay was out of our control, I can understand how frustrating it must have been.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
When a flight is delayed, our team should take all available measures to minimise the disruption and promptly rebook any onward connections on your ticket.<br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear about the error made by our team on this occasion, which meant you had to purchase a new ticket direct with {{{Case.Airline__c}}}. I want to assure you that we’re committed to improving our processes when unforeseen issues happen.<br />
<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture to Frequent Flyer:-&nbsp;</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer: -</strong></em></p>

<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.</p>

<p><br />
<br />
We value your opinion<br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and hope we can welcome you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>